msgstr "Webhook Secret"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:158
msgid "Show"
msgstr "Mostra"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:158
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Nascondi"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:164
msgid ""
"Shared secret used to verify incoming webhook requests. Keep this value "
"private."
msgstr ""
"Segreto condiviso utilizzato per verificare le richieste webhook in arrivo. "
"Mantieni questo valore privato."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:174
msgid "How to wire this up (Stripe, PayPal, WooCommerce, custom)"
msgstr "Come collegare questo (Stripe, PayPal, WooCommerce, personalizzato)"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:177
msgid "Request contract"
msgstr "Contratto di richiesta"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:178
msgid ""
"Your provider (or a small relay you control) sends a signed POST to the "
"Webhook URL above. Listora rejects anything missing the headers below."
msgstr ""
"Il tuo provider (o un piccolo relay che controlli) invia un POST firmato "
"all'URL Webhook sopra. Listora rifiuta qualsiasi cosa manchevole dei valori "
"di intestazione di seguito."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:182
msgid "Header"
msgstr "Intestazione"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:183
msgid "Value"
msgstr "Valore"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:188
msgid ""
"Unix seconds at time of request. Anything more than 5 minutes off the server "
"clock is rejected (replay defence)."
msgstr ""
"Unix secondi al momento della richiesta. Qualsiasi cosa oltre 5 minuti di "
"differenza dall'orologio del server viene rifiutata (difesa da replay)."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:193
msgid "JSON body fields"
msgstr "Campi del corpo JSON"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:197
msgid "Field"
msgstr "Campo"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:198
#: assets/js/admin/type-editor.js:393 assets/js/admin/type-editor.js:489
msgid "Required"
msgstr "Richiesto"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:199
#: includes/import-export/class-csv-importer.php:59
#: includes/import-export/class-hivepress-migrator.php:268
#: templates/blocks/listing-submission/step-basic.php:129
#: templates/blocks/user-dashboard/tab-listings.php:608
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrizione"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:203
msgid "yes"
msgstr "sì"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:203
msgid "WordPress user the credits are added to (matched by email)."
msgstr ""
"Utente WordPress a cui vengono aggiunti i crediti (abbinato per email)."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:204
msgid "or"
msgstr "o"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:204
msgid "one of"
msgstr "uno di"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:204
msgid ""
"`credits` = exact number to add. `amount` = currency value (multiplied by "
"your Credit Rate setting). At least one must be > 0."
msgstr ""
"`credits` = numero esatto da aggiungere. `amount` = valore valuta "
"(moltiplicato per l'impostazione del tasso di credito). Almeno uno deve "
"essere > 0."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:205
#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:206
msgid "recommended"
msgstr "consigliato"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:205
msgid ""
"Provider transaction reference, stored on the ledger row for reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"Riferimento transazione provider, archiviato nella riga di registro per la "
"riconciliazione."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:206
msgid "or your own slug."
msgstr "o il tuo slug personale."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:207
#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:208
#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:209
msgid "optional"
msgstr "facoltativo"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:207
msgid ""
"If set, also assigns the matching Pricing Plan + applies its featured/"
"duration perks."
msgstr ""
"Se impostato, assegna anche il piano di prezzo corrispondente e applica i "
"suoi vantaggi in evidenza/durata."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:208
msgid "Defaults to `payment.completed`. Used in audit-log entries."
msgstr ""
"Utilizza per impostazione predefinita `payment.completed`. Utilizzato nelle "
"voci di registro di audit."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:209
msgid ""
"Unix seconds inside the payload (separate from the header). Lets you sign "
"payloads without sending the header — handy for providers that strip custom "
"headers."
msgstr ""
"Unix secondi all'interno del payload (separato dall'intestazione). Ti "
"permette di firmare i payload senza inviare l'intestazione — pratico per i "
"provider che eliminano le intestazioni personalizzate."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:213 includes/helpers.php:810
msgid "Stripe"
msgstr "Stripe"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:215
msgid "Stripe Dashboard → Developers → Webhooks → Add endpoint."
msgstr "Dashboard Stripe → Developers → Webhooks → Aggiungi endpoint."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:216
msgid ""
"Paste the Webhook URL above; subscribe to event `checkout.session.completed` "
"(or `payment_intent.succeeded` if you use raw PaymentIntents)."
msgstr ""
"Incolla l'URL Webhook sopra; sottoscrivi all'evento "
"`checkout.session.completed` (o `payment_intent.succeeded` se usi "
"PaymentIntents grezzi)."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:217
msgid ""
"Stripe signs with its own header (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora does NOT read "
"that header — you need a tiny relay (Cloudflare Worker, custom mu-plugin, or "
"Pipedream) that re-signs Stripe's payload as `<timestamp>.<body>` with the "
"Listora secret and POSTs here. A 20-line example lives in `docs/integrations/"
"stripe-relay.md`."
msgstr ""
"Stripe firma con la propria intestazione (`Stripe-Signature`). Listora NON "
"legge quell'intestazione — hai bisogno di un piccolo relay (Cloudflare "
"Worker, mu-plugin personalizzato o Pipedream) che firmi di nuovo il payload "
"di Stripe come `<timestamp>.<body>` con il segreto Listora e POSTa qui. Un "
"esempio di 20 righe è in `docs/integrations/stripe-relay.md`."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:218
msgid "In the relay, map Stripe fields → Listora fields:"
msgstr "Nel relay, mappa i campi Stripe → campi Listora:"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:221 includes/helpers.php:811
msgid "PayPal"
msgstr "PayPal"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:223
msgid ""
"PayPal Developer Dashboard → My Apps & Credentials → your app → Webhooks → "
"Add webhook."
msgstr ""
"Dashboard PayPal Developer → My Apps & Credentials → la tua app → Webhooks → "
"Aggiungi webhook."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:224
msgid ""
"Webhook URL = your relay endpoint (PayPal posts IPN-style notifications that "
"need translating to the Listora payload shape)."
msgstr ""
"URL Webhook = l'endpoint del tuo relay (PayPal invia notifiche in stile IPN "
"che devono essere tradotte nella forma del payload Listora)."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:225
msgid ""
"Subscribe to `PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED` (REST API) or use IPN with "
"`txn_type=web_accept` / `payment_status=Completed`."
msgstr ""
"Sottoscrivi a `PAYMENT.CAPTURE.COMPLETED` (REST API) o usa IPN con "
"`txn_type=web_accept` / `payment_status=Completed`."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:226
msgid "Relay maps:"
msgstr "Relay mappa:"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:229
msgid "WooCommerce (same site)"
msgstr "WooCommerce (stesso sito)"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:231
msgid ""
"Easiest path: skip the webhook entirely. Install the matching credit adapter "
"under Listora → Settings → Credits → Credit Mappings; the SDK reads "
"WooCommerce order completion directly and tops up credits in-process."
msgstr ""
"Percorso più facile: salta completamente il webhook. Installa l'adattatore "
"di crediti corrispondente in Listora → Impostazioni → Crediti → Mapping "
"crediti; l'SDK legge il completamento dell'ordine WooCommerce direttamente e "
"accredita i crediti nel processo."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:232
msgid ""
"Alternative (cross-site WC): wire WooCommerce → Settings → Advanced → "
"Webhooks → Add webhook. Topic `Order updated`. Delivery URL = the Listora "
"Webhook URL above. Add a small `woocommerce_webhook_payload` filter that "
"emits the Listora payload shape with the order's `billing_email`, `total`, "
"`id`, and `\"woocommerce\"`."
msgstr ""
"Alternativa (WC tra siti): collega WooCommerce → Impostazioni → Avanzate → "
"Webhook → Aggiungi webhook. Argomento `Order updated`. URL di consegna = "
"l'URL Webhook Listora sopra. Aggiungi un piccolo filtro "
"`woocommerce_webhook_payload` che emette la forma del payload Listora con "
"email di fatturazione dell'ordine, totale, ID e `\"woocommerce\"`."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:235
msgid "Test it works (curl)"
msgstr "Verifica che funzioni (curl)"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:236
msgid ""
"Run this from a terminal to confirm the endpoint accepts a signed request. "
"Replace `<SECRET>` with the Webhook Secret above."
msgstr ""
"Esegui questo da un terminale per confermare che l'endpoint accetta una "
"richiesta firmata. Sostituisci `<SECRET>` con il Webhook Secret sopra."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:245
msgid ""
"Expected response: HTTP 200 with `{\"success\":true,\"credits_added\":10,...}"
"`. Errors return a JSON body with `code` and `message` — check the Audit Log "
"(Listora → Audit Log) for rejection reasons."
msgstr ""
"Risposta prevista: HTTP 200 con `{\"success\":true,\"credits_added\":10,...}"
"`. Gli errori restituiscono un corpo JSON con `code` e `message` — controlla "
"il Registro di audit (Listora → Registro di audit) per i motivi del rifiuto."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:253
msgid "Plans and transactions"
msgstr "Piani e transazioni"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:254
msgid ""
"Where credits are bundled into plans, and where every credit movement is "
"recorded."
msgstr "Dove i crediti sono raggruppati in piani e dove viene registrato ogni movimento di crediti."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:259
msgid "Transactions"
msgstr "Transazioni"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:263
#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:268
msgid "View Transaction Log"
msgstr "Visualizza registro transazioni"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:265
msgid "Per-user credit ledger with filters and CSV export."
msgstr "Registro ledger di crediti per utente con filtri ed esportazione CSV."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:270
msgid "The transaction log appears here once monetization is turned on."
msgstr "Il registro delle transazioni appare qui una volta attivata la monetizzazione."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:275
msgid "Pricing plans"
msgstr "Piani tariffari"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:279
#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:284
msgid "Manage Pricing Plans"
msgstr "Gestisci piani tariffari"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:281
msgid ""
"Bundle credits + listing limits into named plans assigned at submission time."
msgstr ""
"Raggruppa crediti + limiti di inserzione in piani denominati assegnati al "
"momento dell'invio."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:286
msgid "The plans manager appears here once monetization is turned on."
msgstr "La gestione dei piani appare qui una volta attivata la monetizzazione."

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:317
msgid "Pricing"
msgstr "Prezzi"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:318
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "Limiti"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:319
msgid "Payments"
msgstr "Pagamenti"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:323
msgid "Credits settings"
msgstr "Impostazioni crediti"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:371
msgid "Listing Limits per Role"
msgstr "Limiti di inserzione per ruolo"

#: includes/admin/class-credits-settings-tab.php:372
msgid ""
"Configure how many listings each role can submit per period. Beyond the "
"limit, block the submission or allow overflow in exchange for credits."
msgstr ""
"Configura quante inserzioni ogni ruolo può inviare per periodo. Oltre il "
